  m_text: 'Controls-

    Game room-  WASD/arrow keys to move & E key to interact

    Arcade
    game 1- space key

    Arcade game 2- point and click

    Arcade game 3- W for
    up & A for down





    Tip-  after reading letter the first arcade machine
    to go to is the bottom left one'
